<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis AG registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1700 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.35 CHF		  GEARING	12.1 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.FEB.97-16.SEP.98   PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1625 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
